-- Louisville reaches five active rows (Douglass Community Center, two teachers, St. Francis in the Fields, Mahj Haus 502) and sessions
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Louisville plays American mahjong in community centers, a church and a coffee shop. Louisville Parks and Recreation lists American Mah Jongg at the Douglass Community Center, St. Francis in the Fields in Prospect hosts a Mahjong Monday where guests are welcome, and Mahj Haus 502 holds weekly open play at a Heine Brothers Coffee. Mahjong Queens teaches 101 and 102 classes. The church game and Mahj Haus both ask you to bring the current National Mah Jongg League card. If you are new, a 101 class is the place to start.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'louisville';
